OL,3,CMore migrants die trying to cross
OL,4,CChannel to UK
OL,6,FThree migrants have died while trying
OL,7,Fto reach the UK after one of the
OL,8,Fbusiest days for Channel crossings
OL,9,Fthis year.
OL,11,FThe group were found dead on a boat
OL,12,Foff the coast of Dunkirk on Thursday
OL,13,Fmorning, the French coastguard said.
OL,15,FIt comes a day after Prime Minister
OL,16,FAndy Burnham insisted the Government's
OL,17,Fplan to curb Channel crossings was
OL,18,F"working", although he admitted there
OL,19,Fwas "more to do".
