PN,38802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785584875
OL,3,CMore migrants die trying to cross
OL,4,CChannel to UK
OL,6,FThe boat was spotted at around 6am
OL,7,Fwith three people on board who were
OL,8,Ffound unresponsive.
OL,10,FThey were taken to shore by rescue
OL,11,Fcrews before paramedics confirmed they
OL,12,Fhad died, according to a translation
OL,13,Fof a statement from maritime
OL,14,Fauthorities in Cherbourg-en-Cotentin.
OL,16,FWednesday was one of the busiest days
OL,17,Ffor crossings so far this year, with a
OL,18,Fsteady stream of attempts throughout
OL,19,Fthe day amid hot, sunny weather and
OL,20,Fcalm conditions at sea.
